 ["Boshlanishida — susaygan vezikulyar nafas va crepitatio indux", "Avj olgan davrda — bronxial nafas, bronxofoniya kuchaygan", "Tuzalishda — crepitatio redux va jarangdor nam xirillashlar", "Boshlanishidan plevra ishqalanish shovqini bo‘lishi mumkin", "Avj olgan davrda — amforik nafas", "Tuzalishda — hushtaksimon xirillashlar", "Boshlanishida — nafas umuman yo‘q", "Avj olgan davrda — qutisimon tovush ustida vezikulyar nafas"],
 "Mark the statements correctly describing the course of auscultatory findings in lobar pneumonia.",
 ["At onset — diminished vesicular breathing and crepitatio indux", "At the peak — bronchial breathing with increased bronchophony", "In resolution — crepitatio redux and resonant moist crackles", "A pleural rub may be present from the onset", "At the peak — amphoric breathing", "In resolution — wheezes", "At onset — no breath sounds at all", "At the peak — vesicular breathing over a box-like note"],
