 "Mark the correct statements for distinguishing added sounds.",
 ["Moist crackles arise in bronchi", "Crepitation arises in alveoli", "A pleural rub arises in the pleural layers", "Crepitation does not change after coughing", "A pleural rub is often painful", "Moist crackles are heard on sham breathing", "Crepitation gets louder on stethoscope pressure", "A pleural rub disappears after coughing", "Moist crackles occur only at end-inspiration", "Crepitation arises in bronchi"],
 "Soxta nafasda va bosimda faqat plevra ishqalanishi o‘zgaradi; xirillashlar ikkala fazada va yo‘taldan keyin o‘zgaradi.",
