 "Mark the correct pairs of added auscultatory sound and condition.",
 ["Hippocratic succussion splash — hydropneumothorax", "“Falling drop” sound — large cavity with air and fluid", "Hamman’s sign — mediastinal emphysema", "Pleuropericardial rub — pleural inflammation next to the heart", "Stridor — epiglottitis", "Hamman’s sign — asthma", "Succussion splash — emphysema", "Stridor — small-airway spasm", "“Falling drop” — dry pleurisy", "Pleuropericardial rub — COPD"],
 "Plevroperikardial shovqin nafasni ushlaganda susayadi, lekin yurak qisqarishlari bilan bog‘liq qoladi.",
